@root = http://127.0.0.1:42891
@ownerKey = YOUR_OWNER_API_KEY

### Runtime metadata (actual desktop port and both base URLs)
GET {{root}}/runtime

### OpenAI Chat Completions
POST {{root}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "your-model-id",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Hello" }]
}

### Anthropic Messages
POST {{root}}/v1/messages
x-api-key: {{ownerKey}}
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "your-model-id",
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Hello" }]
}
